  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būkomigi kūlwa kūnshokela SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'weji gwa kanaane ng'waka gwa kabīlī gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Dalio, mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkiza kūlī ng'hangi Zakalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Belekia ng'wana Ido; gūhaya gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA walī wabadakīīla no a bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, bawīlage a banhū, Ū SEEBA wa būdūla bose alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nishokelagi nene,’ alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose, ‘nū nene nakūmushokela a bing'we,’ alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūbiza gīt'ūmo baalī a bakūlūgenji bing'we, abo bahangi ba kale bikalaga bakūbawīlaga, Ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose alīhaya gīkī, ‘Galūkagi mulekane nī nzīla jing'we ī jabūbi, nī shīītīle shing'we ī sha malofu.’ Alīyo batabigwile, nūūlū kūnidīlīla ū nene yaya, alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Al'ī haha balī halī lūūlū a bakūlūgenji bing'we? Nūūlū a bahangi, balī ba kūshinga ilalī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īyo nīlagīlaga mu mihayo yane na shilagīlo shane, ītabapandīkile a bakūlūgenji bing'we gīt'ūmo nabalagīīlīlaga batūmami bane a bahangi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A henaho būshosha balīhaya, ‘Ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose watwītīla īyo ītwigeleelilwe kūlwa nzīla na nhūngwa jise, gīt'ūmo walī ahelelile kwīta we ng'wenekīlī.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū adamhīlile falasa yaaza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lwa makūmi abīlī n'inè ng'weji gw'ikūmi na gūmò, ūyo gūkitanagwa ng'weji gwa Shebati; gwalī ng'waka gwa kabīlī gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Dalio, mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkiza kūlī ng'hangi Zakalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Belekia ng'wana Ido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabona shakoolechiwa mu makanza ga būjikū; kwimanīla ū kū būtongi bone wīmīīla munhū adamhīlile falasa yaaza! Walī wīmīīla mu mitī ya bonji būsoga, mu ntubīlo gwa longa lo minzī. Ū kū numa yakwe jalīho na falasa jingī, jaza, ja buluge, na jaape.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbūūja, “Baba kī ī jenīji?” Ū malaika ūyo waniyombyaga ūniwīla, “Lembeeshaga nakoolekeje balī ba nani a benaba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo olī wīmīīla mu mitī ya bonji ūshosha alīhaya, “A benaba balī abo SEEBA walī wabatūma kūja hose hose ū mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būng'wenhela mhola ū malaika ūyo walī wīmīīla mu mitī ya bonji; būhaya, “Twamala ū kūbīta hose pye ū mu sī, twabona gīkī pyī ī sī īlembeelile, hangī īlī mu mhola na kaholele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūhaya, “Ee SEEBA wa Būdūla bose, kūshisha nanalī ūkwikala ūtūgūsaatagwa ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu nī mizengo ī yīngī ū mu Yuda, īyo washishaga myaka makūmi mpungatī wīpelanīlile?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūtūmamīla mihayo milyehu na ya kūlūngūja, akūng'wīlaga ū malaika ūyo walūngalūngaga nū nene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hwe ū malaika ūyo walūngalūngaga nane; ūniwīla “Gūūyū mhayo gūhayage, Ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nalī na wilu būtaale no kūlwa nguno ya Yelusalemu na Sayuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo nagapelanīlile no a mahanga ayo gakwibonaga galī mu mhola. Nguno ū nene naalī naasaaya ī chene, alīyo hado dūhū; lelo a mahanga genayo gūūbongegeja no ū būluhi wabo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ī Yelusalemu yanisaatile no nalīyīshokela, ī numba yane īkūzengwa mo hangī. Ī Yelusalemu īkūzengwa bo kūgoloolwa na lūgoye lo bazengi,’ alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ongejaga kūhaya hangī gīkī, Ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose alīhaya, ‘Ī mizengo yane īkūbeela no, ū SEEBA akwīlūngūja hangī ī Sayuni, akwīsola ī Yelusalemu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mapembe anè na basuji bane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūponya hangī ī liso ī gīkī nūbona ū kū būtongi bone mapembe ane! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika ūyo waniyombyaga nūmūjū, “Ma kī nago a genaya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnishokeja alīhaya, “A genaya h'a mapembe ayo gīsambaaja ī Yuda nī Isilaeli, pyī nī Yelusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
